# A blue conference lanyard round the neck, a grey clip and a tiny ID badge on the chest (blue
# header, a photo, a name line).
name: dev-lanyard
size: 11x12
anchor: neck 8 2
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  B #2980b9
  L #5dade2
  W #ffffff
  g #95a5a6

@frame dev-lanyard
.L.........
.BL.......L
..BL.....LB
...BL...LB.
....BL.LB..
.....KgK...
...KKKKKKK.
...KBBBBBK.
...KgWLLLK.
...KgWWWWK.
...KWLLLWK.
...KKKKKKK.
